{"id":"serveuse","lemma":"serveuse","pos":"noun","rank":2657,"glosses":["waitress","barmaid"],"ipa":"/sɛʁ.vøz/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/Fr-serveuse.ogg/Fr-serveuse.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"serveuses","masculine":"serveur"},"formAudio":{"serveuses":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-serveuses.wav","serveur":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-serveur.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Elle gagne sa vie comme serveuse.","en":"She waits tables for a living.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to win","l":"gagner"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"as"},null]},{"text":"Demande le menu à la serveuse.","en":"Ask the waitress for the menu.","words":[{"g":"to ask","l":"demander"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"slim, small, fine"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]},{"text":"Une jolie serveuse s'occupa de nous.","en":"A pretty waitress waited on us.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"pretty","l":"joli"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to occupy, to take up","l":"occuper"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"we / us"}]},{"text":"Êtes-vous serveur ?","en":"Are you my waiter?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"La serveuse m'a accueilli avec un sourire.","en":"The waitress greeted me with a smile.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to welcome","l":"accueillir"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"to smile"}]}]}